Package: DropSeq.eqtl.susie
Type: Package
Title: Individual-Level SuSiE Fine-Mapping for tensorQTL eQTLs
Version: 0.1.0
Author: nemesh@broadinstitute.org
Maintainer: James Nemesh <nemesh@broadinstitute.org>
Description: Runs individual-level SuSiE fine-mapping (via susieR) for every
    significant eQTL gene in one tensorQTL-derived dataset. Given a
    tensorQTL index-eQTL file, cis-pair file, normalized expression matrix,
    genotype dosage matrix, and covariate file, the package residualizes
    expression and genotypes against the tensorQTL covariates and fits
    susieR::susie() per gene, producing a verbose SNP-gene result table, a
    slim credible-set table, and a one-row-per-gene processing report.
Imports: data.table, susieR, stats, R.utils, pbmcapply
Suggests: testthat, Rfast
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
